{"series":{"id":"god-fortune-dou-zhanlong","slug":"god-fortune-dou-zhanlong","title":"God Fortune Dou Zhanlong","image":"https://donghualife.com/sites/default/files/styles/node_series/public/2026-08/p2934799675_edit_2760158255696768.jpg?itok=afrMHoMG","synopsis":"Para poder contemplar el Libro Celestial, el viejo taoísta Cui liberó accidentalmente al Sapo Dorado Recolector de Tesoros. Fascinado por la prosperidad y el esplendor del mundo mortal, el sapo se reencarnó como humano, dando origen a Dou Zhanlong. Para escapar de la tribulación celestial, el sapo dividió sus tres almas y siete espíritus dentro del orificio espiritual de Dou Zhanlong, creando nueve avatares que fueron enviados a nueve lugares distintos. Estos nueve Dou Zhanlong existen en diferentes espacios-tiempo paralelos: cada vez que uno muere, otro avatar toma su lugar. En total, deberá atravesar Nueve Muertes y Trece Calamidades.Nuestra historia comienza con el primer Doug✨ Capitulos: 16 🖋️Autor: 天下霸唱 (Tianxia Bachang)🎥 Estudio: CG Year | Over the Divine Realms","status":"En Emisión","year":2026,"genres":[],"type":"donghua","src":"donghualife","sourceUrls":["https://donghualife.com/series/god-fortune-dou-zhanlong"],"updatedAt":"2026-09-20T16:29:34.807Z","posterFailed":true},"seasons":[{"id":"god-fortune-dou-zhanlong-t1","slug":"god-fortune-dou-zhanlong-t1","seriesId":"god-fortune-dou-zhanlong","number":1,"image":"https://donghualife.com/sites/default/files/styles/node_series/public/2026-08/p2934799675_edit_2760158255696768.jpg?itok=afrMHoMG","updatedAt":"2026-09-20T12:19:24.517Z","episodeCount":5}],"episodes":[{"id":"god-fortune-dou-zhanlong-t1-e5","slug":"god-fortune-dou-zhanlong-t1-e5","title":"god-fortune-dou-zhanlong-1-episodio-x5","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/episode/god-fortune-dou-zhanlong-1-episodio-x5","servers":[{"name":"rumble.com","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7coo5y/?pub=4m2typ","embed":true}],"seriesId":"god-fortune-dou-zhanlong","seasonId":"god-fortune-dou-zhanlong-t1","numb